d source subject. Article covers the biblical person(s), named place, or named spiritual figure denoted by this exact spelling; multiple persons under one unchanged source article remain together. Actual proper-name capitalization and whole-name boundaries required. Explicit occurrence-level ambiguity exclusions override this rule.","sourceHeadwordId":"Aaron","term":"Aaron"}],"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","matchingRules":["reviewed_exact_headword"],"sourceProvenanceId":"Aaron","sourceTitle":"Aaron"},{"evidence":[{"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","phrase":"Bread of the Presence","senseEvidence":{"basis":"source_verse_citation","originalCitations":[{"anchorIndex":2,"href":"?bref=Exod.39.36","rawReference":"Exod.39.36"}],"ruleId":"BreadofthePresence::Bread of the Presence::source_verse_citation","sourceHeadwordId":"BreadofthePresence"},"text":"the table with all its utensils and the Bread of the Presence;","verse":36}],"id":"BreadofthePresence","label":"Bread of the Presence","matchReviews":[{"ruleId":"BreadofthePresence::Bread of the Presence::source_verse_citation","scope":"source_verse_citation","senseReview":"Reviewed full original phrase headword in its stated biblical sense. The entire phrase must occur and this article must explicitly cite the same verse; no shortened fragment or inferred topical synonym is matched.","sourceHeadwordId":"BreadofthePresence","term":"Bread of the Presence"}],"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","matchingRules":["reviewed_exact_headword"],"sourceProvenanceId":"BreadofthePresence","sourceTitle":"Bread of the Presence"},{"evidence":[{"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","phrase":"LORD","senseEvidence":{"basis":"reviewed_capitalized_divine_title","originalCitations":[],"ruleId":"Lord::LORD::reviewed_capitalized_divine_title","sourceHeadwordId":"Lord"},"text":"From the blue, purple, and scarlet yarn they made specially woven garments for ministry in the sanctuary, as well as the holy garments for Aaron, just a